WEBVTT

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.000
One evening my father said: My son

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.060
I'm dying and soon I'll be gone

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.560
But before my final farewell

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.340
Hear me and hear me well

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.440
Do whatever you want to do

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.600
Have a plan or roll the dice

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:30.280
But one thing is strictly taboo

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.760
Please, follow my advice

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.400
Never google your symptoms

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.160
That is my only prescription

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.760
You got a hundred  diagnosis and  medieval prognoses

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.080
Every sign is a serious condition

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.640
If you google "cough" and "diagnosis"

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:00.840
You have got tuberculosis

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.580
And if you google "fever" and "red"

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:06.980
You've got Ebola and soon will be dead

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.860
And if you google "I've a runny nose"

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.520
It's CSF. Your brain is leaking juice!

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.540
And if you google "itch" and "prognosis"

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.880
Anaphylactic shock or psychosis

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:25.020
Never google your symptoms

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.500
Seldom it brings any wisdom

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:31.480
You want to discover, but you might uncover

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:35.140
That you have an extra chromosome

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.020
So this is what I heard my father say

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:45.260
And then he closed his eyes and passed away

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:48.000
The autopsy report was very clear

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.440
Death from hypochondriac fear

00:01:51.860 --> 00:01:52.900
Which is custom

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.500
when you google

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.000
your symptoms

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:00.240
Never google your symptoms

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.600
The hit list is never awesome

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:06.840
Pain in your left arm? Heart attack alarm!

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.740
Do you feel a little weak?

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.020
Yes. You've got ALS

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.260
If you  have a slight anaemia, you've got leukaemia

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.180
Are you a little crazy?

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:17.880
You've got ADHD!

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.680
So never ever google your symptoms